<title>UK: Century Inns up as report raises bid hopes.</title>
<headline>Century Inns up as report raises bid hopes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Century Inns Plc rose on Wednesday as a report in the Times newspaper said there was speculation of a bid from brewing-to-hotels group Whitbread Plc.</p>
<p>The stock was up 8p at 190-1/2 by 0814 GMT in thin trade of 10,000 shares. Whitbread was up 2-1/2p at 773.  </p>
<p>No-one at Whitbread or Century was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
